        {
          "items": [
            "Barefoot and Brushstrokes with Pool+Golf Cart+Bikes| The Ivy at Inlet Beach<br><br>Step into coastal luxury at this stunning 4-bedroom, 3.5-bath two-story home nestled in the sought-after Ivy community of Inlet Beach. Designed for both relaxation and entertainment, this thoughtfully curated retreat features custom hand-painted artwork throughout, offering a one-of-a-kind artistic ambiance.<br><br>Enjoy movie nights in your private home theater, or step outside to the fully enclosed patio—a serene setting for morning swims or evening cocktails. The nearby community clubhouse offers additional outdoor dining space, restrooms, a BBQ grill, a private pool exclusive to The Ivy Community residents and guests and shaded lounging areas for larger gatherings.<br><br>Guests will appreciate the brand new six-seater electric golf cart, perfect for cruising just 3 minutes to the largest public beach access in the area, featuring 119 parking spaces for convenience. Beach days are effortless with complimentary beach gear, and back at home, enjoy cold drinks and snacks from the fully stocked mini fridge and snack bar—all included with your stay.<br><br>Whether you’re here for a family getaway, group trip, or art-inspired retreat, this home is where coastal charm meets elevated comfort.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
